<metadata><name>Galičica trail MTB-4</name><desc>MTB-4 is one of Galičica National Park's mountain bike trails, several of which link the hiking routes. It runs 3.6 km from Gorica to Sv. Nikola, climbing about 334 m and descending 0 m in the direction drawn, between 706 m and 1,047 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/mtb-4/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
